  "question": {
    "text": "Four point charges <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> are placed on y-axis at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo></math> respectively. The magnitude of the electric field <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> at a point on the x-axis at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>,</mo></math> with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#8811;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo></math> will behave as:",
